WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,280
Then what are you doing for a long time?

2
00:00:01,830 --> 00:00:03,870
I can't eat it, but someone can

3
00:00:04,190 --> 00:00:05,990
I know a big customer from Beijing

4
00:00:06,350 --> 00:00:07,510
The old man at home is seriously ill

5
00:00:07,710 --> 00:00:09,550
Looking for a century-old body all over the world to change my life

6
00:00:10,310 --> 00:00:11,270
The price offered

7
00:00:11,550 --> 00:00:14,840
Where are the people who can buy a street in the county?

8
00:00:15,400 --> 00:00:16,440
I'll contact you now

9
00:00:17,760 --> 00:00:18,720
Hurry up and pick up the provincial capital

10
00:00:18,960 --> 00:00:21,080
Just say that I found six leaves

11
00:00:21,280 --> 00:00:31,040
The century-old six-pipe leaf master with all his heart and tail

12
00:00:31,640 --> 00:00:34,720
The person who can really eat this old man is here.
